<pre class=3D"lang-bash s-code-block"><code data-highlighted=3D"yes" class=
=3D"hljs language-bash"><span class=3D"hljs-meta">#!/bin/bash</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-built_in">ls</span> some_folder
./someaction.sh
<span class=3D"hljs-built_in">pwd</span>
</code></pre>

<p>Save the file</p>

<p>Now run it on the remote server.</p>

<pre class=3D"lang-bash s-code-block"><code data-highlighted=3D"yes" class=
=3D"hljs language-bash">ssh user@remote <span class=3D"hljs-string">'bash -=
s'</span> &lt; /path/to/commands-inc.sh
</code></pre>

