    <div class=3D"s-prose js-post-body" itemprop=3D"text">
<p>The posted answers using multiline strings and multiple bash scripts did=
 not work for me.</p>

<ul>
<li>Long multiline strings are hard to maintain. </li>
<li>Separate bash scripts do not maintain local variables. </li>
</ul>

<p>Here is a functional way to ssh and run multiple commands while keeping =
local context.</p>

<pre class=3D"lang-bash s-code-block"><code data-highlighted=3D"yes" class=
=3D"hljs language-bash">LOCAL_VARIABLE=3D<span class=3D"hljs-built_in">test=
</span>

<span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-title">run_remote</span><=
/span>() {
    <span class=3D"hljs-built_in">echo</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">"=
<span class=3D"hljs-variable">$LOCAL_VARIABLE</span>"</span>
    <span class=3D"hljs-built_in">ls</span> some_folder;=20
    ./someaction.sh <span class=3D"hljs-string">'some params'</span>
    ./some_other_action <span class=3D"hljs-string">'other params'</span>
}

ssh otherhost <span class=3D"hljs-string">"<span class=3D"hljs-subst">$(set=
)</span>; run_remote"</span>
</code></pre>
