<p>This works on Ubuntu 24.04 host and server</p>
<ul>
<li>runs under sudo</li>
<li>runs multiple lines</li>
<li>does not require me to enter my sudo password</li>
</ul>
<pre class=3D"lang-bash s-code-block"><code data-highlighted=3D"yes" class=
=3D"hljs language-bash"><span class=3D"hljs-built_in">cat</span> secure_sud=
o_pwd - &lt;&lt; <span class=3D"hljs-string">EOF | ssh $your_userid@$your_r=
emote_host cat \| sudo --prompt=3D"" -S -- su -
hostname
whoami
# echo commented out line
hostname
whoami
echo line1
EOF</span>
</code></pre>
